<img alt="Relic of the Elemental Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of the Elemental Lords</span></a></td>
<td>700x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
