<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="pad last"></div></div>
<br/>
<br/>The most important items for purchase are naturally the Tier 12 items so that we can start building our set bonuses. <br/>
<br/>You don't necessarily need to pick the Tier 12 items up in any specific order and can decide for yourself based on the following: The best pre-raid set will use all three. Additionally, the chestpiece is not best in slot for Phase 3 as we will instead use an off-piece item, so buying this early could end up being a waste if you get the off-piece in the first weeks. Because of this, I would personally recommend getting the chest after the legs and gloves, but you should still grab it before other valor items as you may use it temporarily to secure the 4-set bonus. <br/>
<br/>Some of you may wish to hold off on purchasing the Tier 12 gloves or legs and may try your luck at getting them to drop in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a>. At the very least you should make sure to have cleared <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a> that week spending your points on the legs or gloves. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71147/relic-of-the-elemental-lords">
<img alt="Relic of the Elemental Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of the Elemental Lords</span></a> can be upgraded using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71617/crystallized-firestone">
<img alt="Crystallized Firestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_diablostone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystallized Firestone</span></a> into a best-in-slot item. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71208/serrated-brimstone-signet">
<img alt="Serrated Brimstone Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_02a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Serrated Brimstone Signet</span></a> is the only other item that is pre-raid best-in-slot, and the following items below it have stronger options from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> vendor. <br/>
<br/>The <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> cap increases by 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> per weekly reset. Due to how the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> cap works, you can farm all the valor points for previous weeks you may have missed.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="fissure-stones">Fissure Stones for Retribution Paladin DPS in Phase 3</h3>Here is our recommended priority for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> purchases:<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
