<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="pad last"></div></div>
<br/>
<br/>This currency is earned by completing <b>Elemental Rune Dungeons</b>, which are enabled by turning on <b>Protocol Inferno</b>.<br/>
<br/>The most important item by far to purchase with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65072/heart-of-rage">
<img alt="Heart of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Rage</span></a>, as this is best-in-slot in Phase 3 and an incredibly powerful trinket. The only other item that is best-in-slot in Phase 3 is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69879/cloudburst-cloak">
<img alt="Cloudburst Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloudburst Cloak</span></a> of the Earthshaker; they are contained within <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232947/satchel-of-the-cloudburst-cloak">
<img alt="Satchel of the Cloudburst Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Cloudburst Cloak</span></a> and you may need to purchase a few of them before you get the Earthshaker version. <br/>
<br/>Next we will want to pick up the Normal Tier 11 Helm &amp; Shoulder tokens, as this 2-set bonus is one of the biggest sources of damage for the pre-raid set.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65025/rage-of-ages">
<img alt="Rage of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rage of Ages</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60226/dargonaxs-signet">
<img alt="Dargonax's Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dargonax's Signet</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60228/bracers-of-the-matredor">
<img alt="Bracers of the Mat'redor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Mat'redor</span></a> are also pre-raid best in slot, so these will be our next priority. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60226/dargonaxs-signet">
<img alt="Dargonax's Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dargonax's Signet</span></a> is the most valuable of these items, and should be the first pick-up out of them. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60228/bracers-of-the-matredor">
<img alt="Bracers of the Mat'redor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Mat'redor</span></a> are only a very minor upgrade to the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> bracers <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71261/gigantiform-bracers">
<img alt="Gigantiform Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gigantiform Bracers</span></a>, but you will most likely not have <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to spare for a while as you buy tier items. <br/>
<br/>The rest of the items from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> are not best-in-slot or pre-raid best-in-slot, but you can use them to fill in gaps in your gearset temporarily. You can purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63679/reclaimed-ashkandi-greatsword-of-the-brotherhood">
<img alt="Reclaimed Ashkandi, Greatsword of the Brotherhood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_50.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reclaimed Ashkandi, Greatsword of the Brotherhood</span></a> if you need a raid-level weapon, but it's easy to simply farm the stronger <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70224/ruthless-gladiators-bonegrinder">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Bonegrinder" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pvp410_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Bonegrinder</span></a> instead in just an hour or two of rated arena matches.<br/>
<br/>
