<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Retribution Paladin DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Head for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best pre-raid helm is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60346/reinforced-sapphirium-helmet">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Helmet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Helmet</span></a> which is from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. We will be pairing the Tier 11 2-set bonus with the Tier 12 2-set bonus. You will replace this with Tier 12 in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> when completing the 4-set bonus.<br/>
<br/>The headpiece <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is for Engineers only and is the best head slot item outside of tier pieces, and allows you to use Cogwheel gems for a large amount of secondary stats, and Engineering is a best-in-slot profession throughout Cataclysm for Retribution. The Cogwheel gems are unique-equipped, so you should use a combination of one of each Hit/<wbr/>Expertise/<wbr/>Mastery depending on what you need.  <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71326/the-horsemans-horrific-helmet">
<img alt="The Horseman's Horrific Helmet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Horseman's Horrific Helmet</span></a> is a really powerful option until you get either the Engineering or Tier 11 helms. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62422/arcanum-of-the-wildhammer">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Wildhammer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Wildhammer</span></a> or <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62368/arcanum-of-the-dragonmaw">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Dragonmaw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Dragonmaw</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> or <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a>
