<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Back for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69879/cloudburst-cloak">
<img alt="Cloudburst Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloudburst Cloak</span></a> is now purchaseable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> currency made from running <b>Elemental Rune Dungeons</b>. This cloak comes with a random suffix that will determine the stats on it. The best suffix is <b>Earthshaker</b>, which has Critical Strike &amp; Hit, followed by <b>Faultline</b>, which has Haste &amp; Mastery. <b>Earthshaker is best-in-slot for Phase 3</b> and will not be replaced this phase. You may need to purchase multiple <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232947/satchel-of-the-cloudburst-cloak">
<img alt="Satchel of the Cloudburst Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Cloudburst Cloak</span></a> before you get the Earthshaker version.<br/>
<br/>Another great option is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71269/mantle-of-fury">
<img alt="Mantle of Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_firelands_fireset_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Fury</span></a> which is from a <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a>-related quest.<br/>
<br/>The PvP cloak <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70384/ruthless-gladiators-cloak-of-prowess">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Cloak of Prowess" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Cloak of Prowess</span></a> has a very high item level, but lacks a secondary stat due to resilience. You may wish to spend your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> on the PvP weapon first if you don't have a weapon from Heroic Phase 1 raids. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58190/floating-web">
<img alt="Floating Web" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Floating Web</span></a> is still pretty strong and is now purchaseable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, though you may want to get Tier 11 (<i>especially the Protection set</i>) first. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67140/drape-of-inimitable-fate">
<img alt="Drape of Inimitable Fate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of Inimitable Fate</span></a> is a random world drop BoE and largely not worth spending money on. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69572/hex-lords-bloody-cloak">
<img alt="Hex Lord's Bloody Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hex Lord's Bloody Cloak</span></a> is an easily attainable epic cloak from Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Back Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a> for Tailors, otherwise <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74247/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a>
