<span class="tinyicontxt">Siamat</span></a></td>
<td>
<a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5396/lost-city-of-the-tolvir">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lost City of the Tol'vir</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Chest for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best chestpiece pre-raid is naturally the Tier 12 chest <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71063/immolation-battleplate">
<img alt="Immolation Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Battleplate</span></a>. The Heroic version is however not going to be best in slot for Phase 3, so you may wish to buy other Tier 12 items first. We will be pairing the Tier 11 2-set bonus with the Tier 12 2-set bonus. <br/>
<br/>An easily acquired option is the crafted Blacksmithing chest <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55060/elementium-deathplate">
<img alt="Elementium Deathplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Deathplate</span></a> which continues to be quite strong and moderately affordable. Since you will be getting <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71063/immolation-battleplate">
<img alt="Immolation Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Battleplate</span></a>, there is not much reason to purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60344/reinforced-sapphirium-battleplate">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Battleplate</span></a>, as it will be replaced quickly - though if you have <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> to spare, feel free. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a>
