<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gloves-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Gloves for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>You'll want to grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71064/immolation-gauntlets">
<img alt="Immolation Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Gauntlets</span></a> from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> in preparation for completing the 2-set or 4-set bonus. You should at the very least make sure to raid <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a> before puchasing them that week. We will be pairing the Tier 11 2-set bonus with the Tier 12 2-set bonus. <br/>
<br/>The PvP 2-set bonus, acquired by using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70488/ruthless-gladiators-scaled-gauntlets">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Scaled Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_pvppaladin_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Scaled Gauntlets</span></a>, is again a very good option. These are relatively easy to farm my queueing few arena matches. The PvP 2-set is better than anything else if it doesn't interfere with Tier 11 or Tier 12 set bonuses. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60345/reinforced-sapphirium-gauntlets">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Gauntlets</span></a> are not really worth purchasing unless you get an upgrade token from Heroic Phase 1 raids, or have extra <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Once <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> opens, Blacksmiths can craft <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69936/fists-of-fury">
<img alt="Fists of Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_raidwarrior_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fists of Fury</span></a> for you which are powerful pre-raid gloves but not as good as using the PvP 2-set or Tier 12 gloves, require materials from the raid, and will be quite expensive - thus it is not recommended to spend money on them. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Gloves Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74254/enchant-gloves-mighty-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Mighty Strength</span></a> plus <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> (<i>Engineers only</i>)<div class="pad"></div>
