<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Waist for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best-in-slot waist <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63490/sky-strider-belt">
<img alt="Sky Strider Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sky Strider Belt</span></a> can be purchased with the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> currency earned by running <b>Elemental Rune Dungeons</b>. This is another item that comes with a random suffix that determines the stats. The best suffix is <b>Earthshaker</b>, which has Critical Strike &amp; Hit, followed by <b>Faultline</b>, which has Haste &amp; Mastery. You may need to purchase multiple <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232963/satchel-of-the-sky-strider-belt">
<img alt="Satchel of the Sky Strider Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Sky Strider Belt</span></a> before you get the Earthshaker version.<br/>
<br/>You can pickup a very good belt <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70326/ruthless-gladiators-girdle-of-prowess">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Girdle of Prowess" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_pvpwarrior_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Girdle of Prowess</span></a> by PvPing and spending your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a>. That being said, if you don't have a 372 item level weapon yet from Heroic Phase 1 raids, you may wish to get a PvP weapon first. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70120/rickety-belt">
<img alt="Rickety Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rickety Belt</span></a> is the next best pre-raid option and is unlocked by completing <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> quests. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62384/belt-of-the-ferocious-wolf">
<img alt="Belt of the Ferocious Wolf" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Ferocious Wolf</span></a> is still strong if you're able to get Exalted with the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a> rotation. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69842/garrs-reinforced-girdle-of-memories">
<img alt="Garr's Reinforced Girdle of Memories" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Garr's Reinforced Girdle of Memories</span></a> drops from a rare spawn elite <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=50056/garr">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Garr</span></a> in the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> but is bind-on-equip and can be purchased. That being said, it's basically just <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62384/belt-of-the-ferocious-wolf">
<img alt="Belt of the Ferocious Wolf" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Ferocious Wolf</span></a> with an <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52222/inscribed-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Inscribed Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Ember Topaz</span></a> socketed, thus it is very slightly worse.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55061/elementium-girdle-of-pain">
<img alt="Elementium Girdle of Pain" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Girdle of Pain</span></a> is a decent bind-on-equip option that can be crafted or purchased, but is not really worth the investment. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c2" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
