<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Legs for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best leg option pre-raid is our Tier 12 legplates <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71066/immolation-legplates">
<img alt="Immolation Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Legplates</span></a>, especially when it completes a 2-set or 4-set bonus. However, you can also roll the dice and hold off on buying them, hoping that they will drop in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a>. You should at the very least make sure to raid <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a> before puchasing them that week. <br/>
<br/>You can also purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65379/sky-strider-greaves">
<img alt="Sky Strider Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sky Strider Greaves</span></a> from the new currency <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> earned by running <b>Elemental Rune Dungeons</b>. This is another item that comes with a random suffix that determines the stats. The best random suffix is <b>Earthshaker</b>, which offers Critical Strike &amp; Hit, followed by <b>Faultline</b>, which offers Haste &amp; Mastery. You may need to purchase multiple <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232964/satchel-of-the-sky-strider-greaves">
<img alt="Satchel of the Sky Strider Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Sky Strider Greaves</span></a> before you get Earthshaker. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67141/corefire-legplates">
<img alt="Corefire Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corefire Legplates</span></a> are a random world drop BoE, and not worth the investment at this point.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Legs Enchant</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56550/dragonscale-leg-armor">
<img alt="Dragonscale Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterscales_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonscale Leg Armor</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
