<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="boots-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Boots for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>Once <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> opens, Blacksmiths can craft <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69946/warboots-of-mighty-lords">
<img alt="Warboots of Mighty Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raidwarrior_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warboots of Mighty Lords</span></a> for you which are the most powerful pre-raid boots that require materials from the raid, and will be quite expensive.<br/>
<br/>Outside of spending the money for the crafted boots, the best pair of boots is the bind-on-equip <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5094/blackwing-descent">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackwing Descent</span></a> trash drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59464/treads-of-savage-beatings">
<img alt="Treads of Savage Beatings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Savage Beatings</span></a>. They should be pretty cheap by this point. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58195/woe-breeders-boots">
<img alt="Woe Breeder's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Woe Breeder's Boots</span></a> can now be purchased for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> and will last you until any of the above boots. They are bind-on-equip and can also be purchased, though might not be worth the investment. These are slightly better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69588/skullcrusher-warboots">
<img alt="Skullcrusher Warboots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skullcrusher Warboots</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a>, which are slightly better than the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62432/gryphon-riders-boots">
<img alt="Gryphon Rider's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gryphon Rider's Boots</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62418/boots-of-sullen-rock">
<img alt="Boots of Sullen Rock" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Sullen Rock</span></a> boots from <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> and <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a> reputations.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Boot Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74238/enchant-boots-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Mastery</span></a>
