<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Retribution Paladin DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Neck for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best two necklaces are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65025/rage-of-ages">
<img alt="Rage of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rage of Ages</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60227/caelestraszs-will">
<img alt="Caelestrasz's Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caelestrasz's Will</span></a>, which are both from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> earned by doing <b>Elemental Rune Dungeons</b>. Since these items perform equally, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65025/rage-of-ages">
<img alt="Rage of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rage of Ages</span></a> is cheaper to purchase, my recommendation would be to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65025/rage-of-ages">
<img alt="Rage of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rage of Ages</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60227/caelestraszs-will">
<img alt="Caelestrasz's Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caelestrasz's Will</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Another great pre-raid neck is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71212/stoneheart-choker">
<img alt="Stoneheart Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_firelands_1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stoneheart Choker</span></a> which is purchased with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, though it's not a top priority to purchase at all. You will likely not have <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to spare for quite a few weeks, so it is a great idea to get yourself one of the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> options instead. Additionally, it's very hard to use this expertise with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65072/heart-of-rage">
<img alt="Heart of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Rage</span></a>, which is why it's not pre-raid best-in-slot despite its 378 item level. <br/>
<br/>You can also purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69885/cloudburst-necklace">
<img alt="Cloudburst Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloudburst Necklace</span></a> from the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> currency earned by running <b>Elemental Rune Dungeons</b>, and of the random suffixes, again, <b>Earthshaker</b> is the best. That being said, there's no reason to spend <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> on this, since <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65025/rage-of-ages">
<img alt="Rage of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rage of Ages</span></a> can also be purchased with this currency and is better. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70107/fireheart-necklace">
<img alt="Fireheart Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_neck_hyjaldaily_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fireheart Necklace</span></a> can also be obtained very early into doing <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> quests. It can be hard to use this expertise with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65072/heart-of-rage">
<img alt="Heart of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Rage</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70382/ruthless-gladiators-choker-of-accuracy">
<img alt="Ruthless Gladiator's Choker of Accuracy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ruthless Gladiator's Choker of Accuracy</span></a> is another strong and easily attainable option. If you don't have a Heroic Phase 1 raid weapon yet, you may want to buy a PvP weapon first. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67138/buc-zakai-choker">
<img alt="Buc-Zakai Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Buc-Zakai Choker</span></a> is pretty powerful and bind-on-equip, but due to being a random world drop it is not going to be cheap and not worth the investment. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62447/gift-of-nadun">
<img alt="Gift of Nadun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea7.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gift of Nadun</span></a> is an option if you manage to get Exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
