<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="passive-trinkets">Passive Trinkets</h5>The best pre-raid passive trinket is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65072/heart-of-rage">
<img alt="Heart of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Rage</span></a> which can be purchased with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> earned in <b>Elemental Rune Dungeons</b>. This is also best in slot in Phase 3, so it's your highest priority purchase from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The second best pre-raid passive trinket is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56393/heart-of-solace">
<img alt="Heart of Solace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_persecution.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Solace</span></a>, which is very easily acquired. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70141/dwyers-caber">
<img alt="Dwyer's Caber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_branch_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dwyer's Caber</span></a> is the second most powerful pre-raid passive trinket before you are able to get into raids. This is another item that must be obtained by unlocking the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> vendors by completing the quest chains and daily quests there, and it's highly recommend for players gearing up to be doing their daily quests there every day. <br/>
<br/>If you're using both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70141/dwyers-caber">
<img alt="Dwyer's Caber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_branch_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dwyer's Caber</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68972/apparatus-of-khazgoroth">
<img alt="Apparatus of Khaz'goroth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apparatus of Khaz'goroth</span></a> together, you really want to use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68972/apparatus-of-khazgoroth">
<img alt="Apparatus of Khaz'goroth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apparatus of Khaz'goroth</span></a> before <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70141/dwyers-caber">
<img alt="Dwyer's Caber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_branch_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dwyer's Caber</span></a> triggers, or you'll end up with a critical strike buff instead of a mastery buff that is more powerful, so this can be a tricky combination to utilize optimally. <br/>
<br/>These two trinkets are followed by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58180/license-to-slay">
<img alt="License to Slay" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">License to Slay</span></a>, which is now available for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. The rest of the trinkets are not worth bothering to get.<div class="pad"></div>
