<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="librams-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Librams for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best pre-raid libram is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71147/relic-of-the-elemental-lords">
<img alt="Relic of the Elemental Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of the Elemental Lords</span></a> which is purchased with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>.<br/>This relic can then be upgraded into the best in slot Heroic version after you begin raiding <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> and acquire the required <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71617/crystallized-firestone">
<img alt="Crystallized Firestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_diablostone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystallized Firestone</span></a> currency from the raid bosses.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70125/relic-of-logosh">
<img alt="Relic of Lo'Gosh" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mount_whitedirewolf.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Lo'Gosh</span></a> can be unlocked by completing <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> quest chains and daily quests, and thus unlocking the required vendor. <br/>
<br/>Until you obtain one of the above librams, you can use either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64674/relic-of-aggramar">
<img alt="Relic of Aggramar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Aggramar</span></a> from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, or buy the slightly worse <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62243/notched-jawbone">
<img alt="Notched Jawbone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Notched Jawbone</span></a> from the auction house.<div class="pad"></div>
