<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="about-the-author">About the Author</h2>This guide is maintained by <b>
<span class="c2">Surveillant</span></b>. I've been doing <span class="c2">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_auraoflight.gif");'></span>Retribution Paladin</span> theorycrafting and guides for WoW Classic for quite a long time now, and write for WoWHead. I also operate the <a href="https://discord.gg/lightclubclassic" target="_blank">Light Club Discord</a>, a place for people to congregate and discuss <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_auraoflight.gif");'>
<span class="c2">Retribution</span></span> topics regarding WoW Classic. You can find me on <a href="https://twitch.tv/surveillantYIKES" target="_blank">Twitch</a>, <a href="https://youtube.com/@Surveillant" target="_blank">YouTube</a>, or on Discord under the name Surveillant. If you have any feedback or suggestions for this article, feel free to leave a comment below and I will reply.</div>